# MDC file format reminder

- Each .mdc file starts with YAML frontmatter delimited by '---'.
- Required fields for our project rules:
  - description: short purpose
  - globs: which files it applies to
  - alwaysApply: true/false
- After frontmatter, write Markdown instructions.
- Keep rules unambiguous, testable, and aligned with CONTINUITY.md workflow.
